Type: project
Package: FraminghamCityData
Title: Framingham, Massachusetts City Data
Version: 0.2.0
Description: Election results, maps, property and Census data for
    Framingham, Massachusetts, in original and analysis-friendly formats.
    This file isn't for building an R package; it lists the packages the
    project needs so they can be installed in one step with
    pak::local_install_deps() (and so GitHub Actions knows what to install).
